\f1\fs22 \'93I understand you\'92re expecting,\'94 Eloise said, with a grandmotherly dose of warmth that made houseplants nervous, even as Sarah half-expected her to append. \'93dearie.\'94\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>A paralysed look of resigned terror made a hostile takeover of Sarah\'92s face.\
<$ScrKeepWithNextSplittable>\'93Unplanned then,\'94 Eloise said. 
